+-- it, and a white neckline. A wide cloud-white cape falls from the back below
+-- the shoulders, its hem a sky-blue line. The waist is a narrow dark corset
+-- laced in white and belted in warm rock tan. Below it a peplum of blue
+-- plates overhangs the white skirt, which hangs from the thighs in five wide
+-- gores a leg, widening from the hip and reaching past the knee.
+local ArmourLookTypes = require("../../ArmourLookTypes")
